2026-10-28T17:39:51.0560887Z {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HSAjuxfRdT6PGP4U5iR6d6","type":"tool_result","content":"{\n  \"issue\": {\n    \"number\": 29,\n    \"title\": \"[New Resource]: aws_marketplaceagreement_agreement\",\n    \"author_association\": \"NONE\",\n    \"labels_at_open\": []\n  },\n  \"as_of\": \"2026-09-26T18:23:51+00:00\",\n  \"form\": {\n    \"template\": \"Request Net New Functionality\",\n    \"missing_required\": [],\n    \"empty_optional\": [],\n    \"used_form\": true\n  },\n  \"services\": {\n    \"resources_mentioned\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_marketplaceagreement_agreement\",\n        \"resource_exists\": false,\n        \"data_source_exists\": false,\n        \"service_label\": null\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_eks_addon\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/eks\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"aws_eks_cluster\",\n        \"resource_exists\": true,\n        \"data_source_exists\": true,\n        \"service_label\": \"service/eks\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"regex_labeler_would_apply\": [\n      \"service/eks\"\n    ],\n    \"primary_service_label\": null\n  },\n  \"versions\": {\n    \"terraform\": null,\n    \"provider\": null,\n    \"latest_release\": \"6.66.0\",\n    \"latest_release_date\": \"2026-09-21\",\n    \"provider_status\": \"not_reported\",\n    \"newer_release_notes\": [],\n    \"newer_fixes\": []\n  },\n  \"similar_issues\": [\n    {\n      \"number\": 41370,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#41370\",\n      \"title\": \"[New Resource]: Bedrock Marketplace Deployments\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"Please implement all resources needed to deploy from Bedrock Marketplace * aws_bedrock_marketplace_deployment * aws_bedrock_marketplace_model terraform No\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2025-02-12T20:11:17Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.186,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 25928,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#25928\",\n      \"title\": \"AWS: Allow for Glue Marketplace Connector-type Connections\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"AWS Glue Studio allows for the creation of Glue Connections that use an AWS Marketplace Connector for Glue. When we try to create a Glue Connection that uses a marketplace connector (Google Bigquery connector for AWS Glue) we're unable to define it in TF because the only [supported connection types]( do not include the type \\\"MARKETPLACE\\\" or the ability to select an existing marketplace connector. \",\n      \"state\": \"closed\",\n      \"state_reason\": \"completed\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2022-07-21T23:38:33Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.164,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 45812,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#45812\",\n      \"title\": \"Add AWS Private Marketplace support\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"AWS Private Marketplace We would like to manage the AWS Marketplace products available for purchase by our organization members using IaC. This feature was previously brought up in [#20601]( but received no traction. I would like this feature reconsidered because it is the easiest solution to curate AI model purchases in Bedrock. hcl aws_private_marketplace_integration { service_linked_role = true\",\n      \"state\": \"open\",\n      \"state_reason\": null,\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-01-05T20:03:46Z\",\n      \"score\": 0.14,\n      \"band\": \"weak\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"number\": 43835,\n      \"ref\": \"hashicorp/terraform-provider-aws#43835\",\n      \"title\": \"Resource for foundation model agreement in aws bedrock\",\n      \"body_excerpt\": \"aws_bedrock_foundation_model_agreement I would like to request the resource *aws_bedrock_foundation_model_agreement*, so that we can use terraform to enable foundational models on accounts in an orga